# Pinned upstream OpenWrt release for the StartWRT image build.
#
# OPENWRT_COMMIT is the commit the release tag must resolve to — the integrity
# pin. openwrt-setup.sh fetches the tag from upstream, verifies it matches this
# commit, and resets the openwrt/ checkout to it before applying the Start9
# delta (openwrt-patches/ + openwrt-overlay/).
#
# To move to a new upstream release: update BOTH values (commit = the tag's
# ^{commit}), then re-run `make start-wrt-openwrt-setup` — if a patch in
# openwrt-patches/ no longer applies, refresh it per CONTRIBUTING.md
# "OpenWrt tree".
OPENWRT_TAG=v25.12.4
OPENWRT_COMMIT=ba915c2ee711d047d5be8575c1e98699119429ab
